                    {
                        "form_id": "6b3adc53-4d70-4485-919b-346e4346f316",
                        "entry_id": "caf210bf-0f28-3d73-8fc7-fbed6514c444",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "воя́ках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ce6c20f1-f217-3e14-9be0-ea4a6720b6f0",
                        "entry_id": "caf210bf-0f28-3d73-8fc7-fbed6514c444",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. испытанный, храбрый воин"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c0f4df6-a938-440f-b618-4263b5bea476",
                                "sense_id": "ce6c20f1-f217-3e14-9be0-ea4a6720b6f0",
                                "text": "Неужели тебя, такого бравого вояку, можно каким-то дурацким сном напугать?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5bc21772-86bf-4baa-922b-30bb0face81f",
                                "sense_id": "ce6c20f1-f217-3e14-9be0-ea4a6720b6f0",
                                "text": "Бравый вояка, подполковник Макаров, формируя свой полк, выстроил командный состав и молниеносно распределил: ты будешь командовать такой-то ротой, ты — такой-то и так далее."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20bf8672-d609-4c1e-9f15-4f23c60b265c",
                                "sense_id": "ce6c20f1-f217-3e14-9be0-ea4a6720b6f0",
                                "text": "За последние дни перехода на завоеванной земле солдаты были взволнованы: они много шутили, пели песни, а вечером на привалах слушали рассказы бывалых уже в деле вояк; приказания офицеров выполнялись с необычайной охотой и быстротой."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3dc17436-2d85-3200-86b9-e75582077c05",
                        "entry_id": "caf210bf-0f28-3d73-8fc7-fbed6514c444",
                        "glosses": [
                            "пренебр. ирон. незадачливый воин или задиристый, воинственный человек"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7bbfb1ac-e977-4458-96ac-0b3478d067a8",
                                "sense_id": "3dc17436-2d85-3200-86b9-e75582077c05",
                                "text": "Бакланов рассмеялся. ― Эх, вояки! Даже кашля человеческого боятся."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9617ad27-2ede-44fe-9a25-df9244ef8940",
                                "sense_id": "3dc17436-2d85-3200-86b9-e75582077c05",
                                "text": "― Да Гальчевский же тебя выпорет, как щенка. Нашёлся тоже вояка! А у кошевого револьвер есть, он в тебя из револьвера пальнет."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6aceefbb-e2b7-45dd-b9b8-afdad3f91a1d",
                        "source_entry_id": "caf210bf-0f28-3d73-8fc7-fbed6514c444",
                        "target_lang_word": "warrior",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "warrior",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63cca0dd-1a30-3318-884e-9a86be96f547",
                                        "entry_id": "08a41d82-fbf5-30d7-b99d-dccffd9e3700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is actively engaged in battle, conflict or warfare; a soldier or combatant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee1d032e-5c09-43e9-85a9-7ecbb6d6148c",
                                                "sense_id": "63cca0dd-1a30-3318-884e-9a86be96f547",
                                                "text": "Orion hit a rabbit once; but though sore wounded it got to the bury, and, struggling in, the arrow caught the side of the hole and was drawn out.[…]. Ikey the blacksmith had forged us a spearhead after a sketch from a picture of a Greek warrior; and a rake-handle served as a shaft."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ba8db62-6ad4-45b6-9b1c-f8a010b926b9",
                                                "sense_id": "63cca0dd-1a30-3318-884e-9a86be96f547",
                                                "text": "[Link:] Gee, it sure is boring around here.\n [King Harkinian:] My boy, this peace is what all true warriors strive for."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "434aba44-e3e8-341b-99d0-8ffeb7a152d9",
                                        "entry_id": "08a41d82-fbf5-30d7-b99d-dccffd9e3700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is aggressively, courageously, or energetically involved in an activity, such as athletics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "91b26b9b-1dc9-4fdc-a965-504fe21db76e",
                        "source_entry_id": "caf210bf-0f28-3d73-8fc7-fbed6514c444",
                        "target_lang_word": "fighter",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fighter",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ccc5dd4-ca8c-32fc-9841-338c3cbfdac2",
                                        "entry_id": "5eaaf0d1-bf20-3a40-83c5-e1ac1bc23a6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who fights; a combatant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d51268e-bc0d-3ca6-b984-284cd036abe9",
                                        "entry_id": "5eaaf0d1-bf20-3a40-83c5-e1ac1bc23a6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A warrior; a fighting soldier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f1291676-e2f6-3055-81c8-29d87426aff8",
                                        "entry_id": "5eaaf0d1-bf20-3a40-83c5-e1ac1bc23a6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pugnacious, competitive person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf1de03c-60db-3891-b905-5697afb2bb5d",
                                        "entry_id": "5eaaf0d1-bf20-3a40-83c5-e1ac1bc23a6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person with a strong determination to resist protracted or severe adversity, especially illness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "poetic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db3dcced-24de-41e0-b223-11e0b90ba3ec",
                                                "sense_id": "cf1de03c-60db-3891-b905-5697afb2bb5d",
                                                "text": "Little weapons / Over the phone / They like to threaten / The life that I know / They say \"Get over here and get into the ring\" / But I'm not really much of a fighter"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba403bd3-528e-3630-9f26-aeb1cb4a736e",
                                        "entry_id": "5eaaf0d1-bf20-3a40-83c5-e1ac1bc23a6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A class of fixed-wing aircraft whose primary purpose is to shoot down other aircraft, sometimes accompanied by a secondary purpose of attacking ground targets."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c149d41c-e91d-3d37-add1-b104eaa801be",
                                        "entry_id": "5eaaf0d1-bf20-3a40-83c5-e1ac1bc23a6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A class of fixed-wing aircraft whose primary purpose is to shoot down other aircraft, sometimes accompanied by a secondary purpose of attacking ground targets.",
                                            "A starfighter"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7ce4cb3-f2b0-44f5-94b8-b5d6e9947b78",
                                                "sense_id": "c149d41c-e91d-3d37-add1-b104eaa801be",
                                                "text": "Task Force 42 consisted of almost two dozen main line spinships, including the carriers Olympus Shadow and Neptune Station. Each of these can launch more than a hundred fighters or ALRs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ecd8bf43-ce83-4dd4-b901-a39bc17a7ee4",
                                                "sense_id": "c149d41c-e91d-3d37-add1-b104eaa801be",
                                                "text": "I toss around [37,654 tonne] dreadnoughts like they were fighters; dimly aware of the former crews being crushed to liquescence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8201dee-d841-31ab-a770-3f6bb0fac125",
                                        "entry_id": "5eaaf0d1-bf20-3a40-83c5-e1ac1bc23a6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A participant in boxing or any martial art."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45067c23-1c51-3ab8-b5d0-aea0849d7196",
                                        "entry_id": "5eaaf0d1-bf20-3a40-83c5-e1ac1bc23a6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A firefighter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd2fdd85-015e-3773-b862-86e8af0cdde2",
                                        "entry_id": "5eaaf0d1-bf20-3a40-83c5-e1ac1bc23a6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A game with a focus on physical combat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "539d95dd-68f0-4899-8b66-c8f4d289a266",
                                                "sense_id": "dd2fdd85-015e-3773-b862-86e8af0cdde2",
                                                "text": "Still, it's excellent software, especially for one-on-one fighting titles such as the King Of Fighters series, classic Street Fighter II variants, and newer one-on-one fighters such as Garou."
                                            }
                                        ]
